{"name": "Castleborne Survivors", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The castle has been swallowed by darkness, and monsters are pouring in from every direction. Fight your way through the horde and survive until the end!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"386\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829710/extras/40bbb38249f9c2c0f136ac5ee0ea712c.poster.avif?t=1787109470\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829710/extras/40bbb38249f9c2c0f136ac5ee0ea712c.webm?t=1787109470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829710/extras/40bbb38249f9c2c0f136ac5ee0ea712c.mp4?t=1787109470\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A survivors-like game, now with side-scrolling action combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Castleborne Survivors blends roguelite progression with Metroidvania-inspired elements. Upgrade, enhance, merge, and enchant your way to greater power, until even overwhelming waves of monsters are no longer something to fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is no longer a top-down survivors experience. Move, reposition, and dodge your way through the swarm \u2014 or build a weapon setup so powerful that enemies are wiped out before they can even reach you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather coins in each run to buy permanent upgrades and push deeper into the castle on your next attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Synthesize Your Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Synthesize your weapons with passives to create even more powerful weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"386\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829710/extras/d26bc2dd13424a7b850f71b305c773bf.poster.avif?t=1787109470\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829710/extras/d26bc2dd13424a7b850f71b305c773bf.webm?t=1787109470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829710/extras/d26bc2dd13424a7b850f71b305c773bf.mp4?t=1787109470\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enchant Your Signature Weapon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enchant your character\u2019s signature weapon to give it even more powerful effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"386\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829710/extras/29b8098f14df5cf03e7398a24063b8a5.poster.avif?t=1787109470\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829710/extras/29b8098f14df5cf03e7398a24063b8a5.webm?t=1787109470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829710/extras/29b8098f14df5cf03e7398a24063b8a5.mp4?t=1787109470\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Two-Player Co-op</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supports local two-player co-op on the same screen. Online co-op is currently in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"386\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829710/extras/03245a9f23a73aac5243fa846a74cba4.poster.avif?t=1787109470\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829710/extras/03245a9f23a73aac5243fa846a74cba4.webm?t=1787109470\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829710/extras/03245a9f23a73aac5243fa846a74cba4.mp4?t=1787109470\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A survivors-like game with side-scrolling action combat. Slash, dodge, and mow down endless monsters in a gothic horror castle. Upgrade with every choice, snowball out of control, and survive until the very end.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829710/0a61f10072b498d04af5790ba1dc6ec296d51950/header.jpg?t=1787109470", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Bullet Heaven", "2D Platformer", "Side Scroller", "Action", "Metroidvania"], "developers": "GameVerse", "publishers": "GameVerse", "release_date": "Jul 19, 2026", "price": "$3.99", "appid": "4829710", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "20 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/X02BoCr605k", "first_seen": 1787672429.555697}